# interplay_diff_fragmented_pages: The same work in three tasks whose data pages lie differently in guest RAM: one after another, one page apart each (no two adjacent), and in reverse order. Buffers of four pages then span guest pages that are not contiguous, and a copy and a dispatch cross their boundaries; the results agree byte for byte (in-process through the task's mapping; in the service through the shared ranges).
